# Test Intent: ResponsiveBreakpoint

Site: nordbank-probes
Requested by: monitoring team
Date: 2026-07-13

## Target URL

Open the file `probes/responsive-breakpoint/index.html`.

## Desired Flow

I opened the page in a normal desktop-sized window. The "Transfer money" button
was visible. I clicked it and the page confirmed the transfer had started.

## Element Hints

- At a desktop viewport the primary "Transfer money" button is visible; at a
  narrow width it collapses into a hamburger menu. The check runs at the standard
  desktop viewport, so the desktop button should be used.

## Values to Capture

(none)

## Success Criteria

The "Transfer money" button is visible at the desktop viewport, and clicking it
shows the transfer has started.

